WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:09.235
The young monk ran to the government office in Hapcheon.

2
00:00:09.236 --> 00:00:13.123
He told the official what he had seen.

3
00:00:13.124 --> 00:00:18.829
"Bandits are robbing the temple?" The official was stunned.

4
00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:25.571
"Yes . . . sir," the monk said, out of breath.

5
00:00:25.572 --> 00:00:33.119
The official quickly gathered his soldiers.

6
00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:41.204
They ran toward the temple.

7
00:00:41.205 --> 00:00:47.100
*** In the temple the bandits finished filling their

8
00:00:47.101 --> 00:00:51.770
carts. "We should get out of here before we get caught," Gildong

9
00:00:51.771 --> 00:00:54.991
said. "Let's go through the forest," Mok

10
00:00:54.992 --> 00:00:58.734
said. "It will be safer than traveling on the

11
00:00:58.735 --> 00:01:02.065
road." Gildong looked at the carts and

12
00:01:02.066 --> 00:01:03.839
frowned. "The carts are too

13
00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:08.506
heavy. Pulling them through the forest won't

14
00:01:08.507 --> 00:01:11.570
work." "What should we do?" Mok

15
00:01:11.571 --> 00:01:15.860
asked. Gildong thought for a

16
00:01:15.861 --> 00:01:18.417
moment. "Take the main road back to the

17
00:01:18.418 --> 00:01:20.787
hideout. I'll make sure no one finds

18
00:01:20.788 --> 00:01:31.025
you." Mok looked confused, but he nodded. "Move

19
00:01:31.026 --> 00:01:37.025
out!" After the bandits left, Gildong opened his fan.

20
00:01:37.026 --> 00:01:41.102
"Transform!" Poof! Gildong turned into an old

21
00:01:41.103 --> 00:01:44.063
monk. He checked his

22
00:01:44.064 --> 00:01:47.968
clothing. "Not bad," he thought,

23
00:01:47.969 --> 00:01:52.744
grinning. He ran toward

24
00:01:52.745 --> 00:01:56.986
town. Soldiers carrying spears were hurrying along the

25
00:01:56.987 --> 00:02:00.193
road. An official was leading

26
00:02:00.194 --> 00:02:10.185
them. Gildong ran toward them. "Help!

27
00:02:10.186 --> 00:02:13.103
Help!" "What happened?" the official

28
00:02:13.104 --> 00:02:16.768
asked. "Bandits stole everything from the temple

29
00:02:16.769 --> 00:02:20.403
storeroom! Then they ran off!" Gildong said.

30
00:02:20.404 --> 00:02:24.660
"Which way did they go?" the official asked.

31
00:02:24.661 --> 00:02:31.809
Gildong pointed into the forest.

32
00:02:31.810 --> 00:02:41.023
"They went deep into the woods. Please catch them. Hurry!"

33
00:02:41.024 --> 00:02:53.686
The official and the soldiers ran into the woods.

34
00:02:53.687 --> 00:03:00.059
Gildong chuckled. "That was too easy."

35
00:03:00.060 --> 00:03:06.029
Poof! He turned back into himself and opened his fan.

36
00:03:06.030 --> 00:03:09.710
"To the hideout!"

37
00:03:09.711 --> 00:03:20.805
Thwoosh! Wind rushed, and the scenery around him changed.

38
00:03:20.806 --> 00:03:26.366
In an instant he was back at the hideout.

39
00:03:26.367 --> 00:03:32.950
"Oof!" Gildong knocked into someone.

40
00:03:32.951 --> 00:03:36.271
Nabi got up and dusted herself off.

41
00:03:36.272 --> 00:03:39.476
"Watch where you're going, little lord!"

42
00:03:39.477 --> 00:03:42.375
"Sorry," Gildong said.

43
00:03:42.376 --> 00:03:46.218
"Where are the others?" Nabi asked.

44
00:03:46.219 --> 00:03:49.171
"They'll be here soon."

45
00:03:49.172 --> 00:03:55.476
A while later Gildong heard singing as the other thieves arrived.

46
00:03:55.477 --> 00:04:00.116
"We robbed the temple! It was very simple!

47
00:04:00.117 --> 00:04:06.714
Thanks to Hong Gildong!"

48
00:04:06.715 --> 00:04:10.776
The thieves' carts were loaded with grain and treasure.

49
00:04:10.777 --> 00:04:15.762
Some of the men were wrapped in colorful silk.

50
00:04:15.763 --> 00:04:23.009
Nabi's eyes went wide. "We're rich!"

51
00:04:23.010 --> 00:04:25.527
Mok jumped onto a cart.

52
00:04:25.528 --> 00:04:28.424
"Hong Gildong should be our leader!

53
00:04:28.425 --> 00:04:31.332
We couldn't have done it without him!"

54
00:04:31.333 --> 00:04:34.809
"Are you sure?" Gildong said in surprise.

55
00:04:34.810 --> 00:04:37.097
"I just joined your group."

56
00:04:37.098 --> 00:04:41.360
The thieves cheered noisily and sang again.

57
00:04:41.361 --> 00:04:46.295
"We'll be rich forever! And feel hungry never!

58
00:04:46.296 --> 00:04:51.953
Thanks to Hong Gildong!"

